pi.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T16:57:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T22:15:31Z","body":"@TokageItLab feel free to use the https://github.com/V-Sekai/godot/ or you can use your own branch under https://github.com/TokageItLab/godot","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725249879/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726284427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100984#issuecomment-2726284427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100984","id":2726284427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6if8yL","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T06:39:00Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T06:42:57Z","body":"For consistency (Copy/ConvertModifier does not contain the word \"Bone\") and to account for the possibility of setting non-bone targets in the future, I renamed TrackBoneModifier3D to AimModifier3D as a more generic name. TrackModifier3D is another idea, but the word \"track\" has many homonyms, so the word \"aim\" was chosen to match with VRMConstraint.\r\n\r\nThere is a possibility of a little confusion with LookAtModifier3D, but AimModifier3D has BoneConstraint3D as its base class, so I assume that this is not a problem.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726284427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727355594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100984#issuecomment-2727355594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100984","id":2727355594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikCTK","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T11:55:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T11:55:41Z","body":"Fixed several bugs discovered while applying Blender's constrained settings for actual use:\r\n\r\n- Fixed a problem with inverse_lerp causing division by zero when target's range in ConvertTransformModifier is 0\r\n- Fixed a problem with incorrect rest space in AimModifier (this PR includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104217)\r\n- Fixed an issue with incorrect conversion of AimModifier's without-euler mode\r\n\r\nTwist without constraint:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cdb6d448-626f-49f9-8203-1a2883640fea)\r\n\r\nTwist with constraint:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aadb3ff6-ff42-49ed-a1c9-e099de92ae6a)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727355594/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728985376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100984#issuecomment-2728985376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100984","id":2728985376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iqQMg","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T10:29:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T10:29:07Z","body":"Improved handling of zero division in ConvertTransformModifier. Also, \"target bone\" has been renamed to \"reference bone\".\r\n\r\nWhile \"target\" in Aim is clear, the word \"target\" in Convert and Copy is a bit confusing (although Blender consistently calls it \"target\"). This rename would make Aim \"target\" to \"reference\", but I think it's still understandable.\r\n\r\nIf anyone has any other better names, suggestions are welcome.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728985376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777220885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100984#issuecomment-2777220885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100984","id":2777220885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6liQcV","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"",