okageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T10:02:27Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T10:12:04Z","body":"@scotdoria Copy/ConvertTransform mod transfers are performed in local space. Several values (local by based rest, based current pose, based initial transform) can be calculated by combining the Relative/Additive options. You can find the explanation in the class reference.\r\n\r\nIn the future, model/global spaces possibly also be available, but it will take time to implement many safety calculations. The current implementation focuses on achieving natural character posing by covering compatibility with the VRM format and some Blender settings.\r\n\r\nBy the way, if local space is not your intended space after retargetingg rest may be overridden by retargeter, so please set up the Advanced import option to use RetargetModifier.\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97824","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995777315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300809177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100984#issuecomment-3300809177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100984","id":3300809177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EvlnZ","user":{"login":"gaoyan2659365465","id":24961172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTYxMTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24961172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaoyan2659365465","html_url":"https://github.com/gaoyan2659365465","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaoyan2659365465/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaoyan2659365465/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c